sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Administrador
  participant W as admin-web
  participant G as GraphQL Gateway
  participant S as Simulador (Members, Memberships, Payments, Access Control)
  participant K as Kafka
  participant Q as Consolidated Queries
  A->>W: Registrar miembro
  W->>G: mutation registerMember
  G->>S: POST /members (Members)
  S-->>K: MEMBER_REGISTERED en members.events
  K-->>Q: proyecta el miembro en queries_db
  A->>W: Asignar plan
  W->>G: mutation createMembership
  G->>S: POST /memberships (estado PENDING)
  S-->>K: MEMBERSHIP_CREATED en memberships.events
  A->>W: Registrar pago
  W->>G: mutation registerPayment
  G->>S: POST /payments (Payments)
  S-->>K: PAYMENT_REGISTERED en payments.events
  K-->>S: Memberships consume el pago y activa la membresía
  S-->>K: MEMBERSHIP_ACTIVATED en memberships.events
  K-->>S: Access Control actualiza access_db
  K-->>Q: proyecta la membresía activa
  A->>W: Validar ingreso (torniquete)
  W->>G: mutation registerAccessAttempt
  G->>S: POST /access-attempts
  S->>S: Access Control decide con su estado local
  S-->>K: ACCESS_GRANTED o ACCESS_DENIED en access.events
  K-->>Q: proyecta el intento
  A->>W: Ver ficha consolidada
  W->>G: query member(id)
  G->>Q: GET /member-overviews/{id}
  Q-->>G: miembro, membresía y accesos recientes
  G-->>W: respuesta GraphQL
